This is not real code and it is not a pattern to copy. It is a fabricated diff
used to exercise the review agent, with defects planted on purpose: a PostgREST
filter built by string interpolation, no authorization check on an /api/admin/
route, an unbounded limit, patient e-mail rendered client-side, and no tests.
A run that misses those is a run to go and fix the prompt over.

Everything below is the fixture.

